Value INTERFACE (\S+)
Value STATUS (administratively down|admin down|up|down|\S+)
Value SPEED (\S+)
Value DUPLEX (\S+)
Value VLAN (\d+|\S+)
Value TYPE (\S+)
Value DESCRIPTION (.*)

Start
  ^(?:Port|Interface)\s+Link\s+Speed\s+Duplex\s+Vlan\s+Type(?:\s+Description)?
  ^(?:Port|Interface)\s+Status\s+Speed\s+Duplex\s+Vlan(?:\s+Description)?
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${STATUS}\s+${SPEED}\s+${DUPLEX}\s+${VLAN}\s+${TYPE}\s+${DESCRIPTION}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${STATUS}\s+${SPEED}\s+${DUPLEX}\s+${VLAN}\s+${TYPE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${STATUS}\s+${SPEED}\s+${DUPLEX}\s+${VLAN}\s+${DESCRIPTION}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${STATUS}\s+${SPEED}\s+${DUPLEX}\s+${VLAN}\s*$$ -> Record
